{
  "text": " No ex. For a person you know you will not get an ex back from. Or if you are annoyed with someone or a guy you don't really know. Ex. Standard for any friend or a girl you don't really know. XX. A girl you like. XXX+. Flirting or playing a game with someone or going overboard. Some people really do take notice of the amount of exes they are getting. If you send XX to a girl you may get XXX back. But if you drop back down to an ex after you almost certainly will not get XXX back again. People get offended if you provide no exes unless you are renowned for being a no ex. Unfortunately this practice is dying as most people send multiple shorter messages rather than a lot less frequent texts. Meaning that sign-offs are less necessary. Thanks for watching!",
